PRC-01 Change Notice P5-r2

Effective October 1, 2026 · Issued by Procurement Operations


WHAT CHANGES
AP remains the first stop for an invoice without a recorded receipt. Missing-receipt cases still unresolved after two business days go to Procurement Operations.

WHAT DOES NOT CHANGE
All other stages (P1, P2, P3, the matching step in P4, and P5 payment release) are unchanged.

NOT SPECIFIED
How holidays affect the two-business-day count is not specified.

Northstar Services is a fictional company. All names, figures, and dates are training material.
